{"title":"Career Roadmap — BIM Coordinator","role":"BIM Coordinator","summary":"A BIM Coordinator manages the coordination of digital building and infrastructure models across disciplines such as architecture, structural engineering, MEP, civil infrastructure and construction.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Smart Infrastructure / Smart Cities Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BIM Coordinator manages the coordination of digital building and infrastructure models across disciplines such as architecture, structural engineering, MEP, civil infrastructure and construction."},{"type":"p","text":"The role ensures that different engineering teams work from coordinated digital information and that design conflicts, constructability issues, information gaps and model-quality problems are identified before construction."},{"type":"p","text":"A BIM Coordinator typically works across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM modelling"},{"text":"Model coordination"},{"text":"Clash detection"},{"text":"Design coordination"},{"text":"BIM standards"},{"text":"Common Data Environments"},{"text":"4D/5D BIM"},{"text":"Construction planning"},{"text":"Quantity information"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Infrastructure information management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The career can progress toward BIM Manager, Digital Construction Manager, Information Manager or Digital Engineering Lead."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/B.E."},{"text":"Engineering + BIM software + digital construction"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"BIM Engineer / BIM Modeler"},{"text":"Discipline modelling and documentation"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"BIM Coordinator"},{"text":"Multidisciplinary coordination and clash resolution"}],[{"text":"2037–2041"},{"text":"Senior BIM Coordinator / BIM Manager"},{"text":"Project-level BIM management"}],[{"text":"2041–2046"},{"text":"BIM / Digital Engineering Lead"},{"text":"Digital delivery and organizational BIM strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering & Construction Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Building materials"},{"text":"Basic civil engineering"},{"text":"Construction technology"},{"text":"Surveying"},{"text":"Structural fundamentals"},{"text":"Electrical/mechanical fundamentals"},{"text":"Computer applications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to read:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural drawings"},{"text":"Structural drawings"},{"text":"MEP drawings"},{"text":"Civil/site drawings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — BIM Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM concepts"},{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Building components"},{"text":"Construction documentation"},{"text":"Architectural modelling"},{"text":"Structural modelling"},{"text":"MEP modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core BIM concept"},{"type":"p","text":"BIM is not simply 3D CAD."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Geometry","Information","Coordination","Lifecycle"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A BIM model should contain useful information about the assets represented by the model."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Multidisciplinary Coordination"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural BIM"},{"text":"Structural BIM"},{"text":"MEP BIM"},{"text":"Civil/infrastructure BIM"},{"text":"Clash detection"},{"text":"Model federation"},{"text":"Model review"},{"text":"Design coordination"},{"text":"Construction sequencing"},{"text":"Quantity extraction"},{"text":"BIM standards"},{"text":"Common Data Environments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to coordinate:"},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Structure"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"MEP"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Civil / Infrastructure","Federated BIM Model","Clash Detection","Coordination","Resolved Design","Construction"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — BIM Coordination & Digital Construction"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM execution planning"},{"text":"Model coordination"},{"text":"Information requirements"},{"text":"Clash management"},{"text":"Model audits"},{"text":"BIM quality control"},{"text":"4D BIM"},{"text":"5D BIM"},{"text":"Quantity takeoff"},{"text":"Construction simulation"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Asset information"},{"text":"BIM automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The final-year project should ideally coordinate a complete multidisciplinary building or infrastructure model."}]},{"heading":"BIM Software Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Autodesk Revit — Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural modelling"},{"text":"Structural modelling"},{"text":"MEP modelling"},{"text":"Families"},{"text":"Parameters"},{"text":"Worksets"},{"text":"Views"},{"text":"Sheets"},{"text":"Schedules"},{"text":"Templates"},{"text":"Model linking"},{"text":"Collaboration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Navisworks — Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Model federation"},{"text":"Clash detection"},{"text":"Clash tests"},{"text":"Search sets"},{"text":"Timeliner"},{"text":"Quantification"},{"text":"Model review"},{"text":"Coordination reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Navisworks is particularly important for a BIM Coordinator."},{"type":"h","text":"AutoCAD — Intermediate–Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2D drafting"},{"text":"Layer management"},{"text":"Blocks"},{"text":"Xrefs"},{"text":"Annotation"},{"text":"Drawing standards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Civil 3D"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Terrain"},{"text":"Corridors"},{"text":"Site infrastructure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"InfraWorks"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infrastructure visualization"},{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Bridges"},{"text":"Site planning"},{"text":"Conceptual infrastructure modelling"}]}]},{"heading":"OpenBIM & Interoperability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BIM Coordinator should understand that projects may involve multiple software platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IFC"},{"text":"BCF"},{"text":"COBie"},{"text":"OpenBIM concepts"},{"text":"Model exchange"},{"text":"Data interoperability"},{"text":"Coordinate systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Native model","IFC/open format","Federated coordination","Issue management"]}]},{"heading":"BIM Standards & Information Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ISO 19650 principles"},{"text":"BIM Execution Plan"},{"text":"Employer's Information Requirements"},{"text":"Exchange Information Requirements"},{"text":"Common Data Environment"},{"text":"Naming conventions"},{"text":"Model versioning"},{"text":"Information classification"},{"text":"Information delivery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"BIM information workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Information Requirements","BIM Execution Plan","Model Production","Common Data Environment","Coordination","Review","Approval","Information Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"For actual project work, always follow the standards and contractual requirements applicable to that project and jurisdiction."}]},{"heading":"Clash Detection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a core BIM Coordinator responsibility."},{"type":"h","text":"Hard Clash"},{"type":"p","text":"Two physical elements occupy the same space."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"HVAC duct → Structural beam"},{"type":"h","text":"Soft Clash"},{"type":"p","text":"Elements do not physically intersect but lack required clearance."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Equipment → insufficient maintenance clearance"},{"type":"h","text":"Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Collect Models","Federate Models","Run Clash Detection","Classify Clashes","Assign Responsibility","Coordinate Solution","Update Models","Re-run Clash Test","Close Issue"]}]},{"heading":"BIM Coordination Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to coordinate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Architecture ↔ Structure"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Walls"},{"text":"Beams"},{"text":"Columns"},{"text":"Slabs"},{"text":"Openings"},{"text":"Shafts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Structure ↔ MEP"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duct openings"},{"text":"Pipe penetrations"},{"text":"Cable trays"},{"text":"Structural clearances"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Architecture ↔ MEP"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ceiling services"},{"text":"Equipment"},{"text":"Doors"},{"text":"Access panels"},{"text":"Maintenance spaces"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Civil ↔ Building"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site levels"},{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Utilities"},{"text":"Underground services"}]}]},{"heading":"Construction Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BIM Coordinator needs more than software skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Construction sequencing"},{"text":"Concrete construction"},{"text":"Steel structures"},{"text":"Masonry"},{"text":"HVAC"},{"text":"Plumbing"},{"text":"Electrical installation"},{"text":"Fire protection"},{"text":"Finishes"},{"text":"Site logistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how a building is ac